---
name: Public copy rules
description: What must never appear in public ANEXOMAIL marketing copy, and how AI is presented on the site
type: constraint
---
Public website copy pe ye baatein NEVER likhni:
- "replaces Zoho Mail / Google Workspace" ya kisi competitor ka naam target ke tor pe. Ye internal strategy hai, founder aur builder ke beech ki baat.
- Internal infra details (server IP, port map, PM2, stack names).

**Why:** Founder ka rule — strategy secret hai, website pe sirf product value.

AI ka rule: anexomail.com ke landing pe AI product ka full pitch nahi. Sirf ek teaser card + "ANEXOMAIL AI" nav link jo /ai page pe le jaye; wahan se ai.anexomail.com pe out-link.

UI bar high hai: clean, saaf, premium (AXO Email jaisa clarity level). Nav labels whitespace-nowrap, logo ANEXO+MAIL two-tone, hero + email-address input CTA, cards clean.
